MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR VAULT WORLDWIDE:
Full language: docs/LANGUAGE.md — portable BLACK LANTERN canon (tokens, vetoes, SPECK save format, take/leave). Obey that file.
Overnight agent brief: docs/OVERNIGHT_PROMPT.md.
Product truth: PRODUCT.md. Visual system after build: DESIGN.md.

This is a dark studio: four tools as a fixed layout, not a dashboard, not a canvas OS, not stacked billboards.
Quiet project cards are the manager. Modest radius (~10px) is allowed on those cards. No DateBlocks, no SaaS kanban chrome, no section titles.

PALETTE: Ground charcoal · panel/card slate steps · off-white type · muted secondary · one highlighter red (not IMP `#E10600`).
Highlighter = selection block on the directory, FIND marks, urgent, live caret.
One accent. Cobalt has left. Paper/INV invert is not the identity.

TYPE: Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial only. No Oswald as identity. No JetBrains. No Space Grotesk.

COMPOSITION (desktop studio, not a PWA, not mobile-first):
1. Dark field. Manager fixed on top, directory fixed under it, scratch sidebar on the right (~320px). FIND is the one command field (top of the sidebar). Sections do not drag.
2. One work graph. Directory is the tree. Manager is the same nodes as quiet stage cards (position encodes stage; no FOCUS/GATEWAY billboards). Empty lane still creates. Click a card to focus the directory to that subtree. Click a title, type.
3. Naked unix directory: stems `│ ├── └──`, highlighter-red block behind the live name. Trailing `_` adds a child. TAB indent/outdent. Space / shovel stages onto the manager.
4. Scratch blocks snap-reorder vertically. Ghost `_ LINK` / `_ PIC` / `_ FILE` stay inert. NOTE when a txt block is focused; else FIND. `CLEAR` is a typed command. No DOS `>` dock slab.
5. SPECK source is the save format (`speck-os-v1`). It is not the compositor costume and not a Forth/DOS taskmaster.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks cards, jagged day cards, SaaS kanban chrome (avatars, KPIs, progress bars, “+ New Deal”), amber theme, JSON-as-database, second prompt, cobalt lash, dump-parser dock, salt organs as identity (CAL / SEAL / SKULL), organ PLACE-drag, grain/scan overlays, Oswald plaques.
Do not revive beige cassette as the OS identity, month-as-OS as home, paper/black IMP canvas, or a Tailwind binder dashboard.
